{%- comment -%}
  FAQ for the Name Necklace product page (rendered by main-product when the live name preview is on), with FAQPage structured data.
{%- endcomment -%}
<section class="product-faq page-width" aria-labelledby="NameNecklaceFaq">
  <h2 class="section-heading" id="NameNecklaceFaq">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
  <div class="product-faq__list" data-product-accordions>
      <details class="product__accordion" data-product-accordion>
        <summary>Can I personalise the necklace with any name?</summary>
        <div class="product__accordion-content"><p>Yes! You can personalise your necklace with a name, word or initials of your choice.</p></div>
      </details>
      <details class="product__accordion" data-product-accordion>
        <summary>Can I preview my necklace before placing an order?</summary>
        <div class="product__accordion-content"><p>Absolutely! Use our Name Necklace Preview tool to type in your name, explore different fonts and see how your necklace will look before ordering.</p></div>
      </details>
      <details class="product__accordion" data-product-accordion>
        <summary>What materials are available?</summary>
        <div class="product__accordion-content"><p>Our Name Necklaces are available in the material and finish options listed on the product page. Sterling Silver, 22K Gold Plated, Yellow Gold and White Gold.</p><p>Please refer to the available selections when ordering.</p></div>
      </details>
      <details class="product__accordion" data-product-accordion>
        <summary>How long does it take to make my necklace?</summary>
        <div class="product__accordion-content"><p>As each necklace is made to order, production takes time. We need 5-7 days to manufacture and deliver islandwide, or contact us for any express delivery.</p></div>
      </details>
      <details class="product__accordion" data-product-accordion>
        <summary>Can I make changes to my order after placing it?</summary>
        <div class="product__accordion-content"><p>As each necklace is personalised and made specifically for you, we may not be able to accommodate changes once production has started. Please double-check your spelling and design before confirming your order.</p></div>
      </details>
      <details class="product__accordion" data-product-accordion>
        <summary>Can I order a necklace in a different language?</summary>
        <div class="product__accordion-content"><p>Yes you can! Please get in touch with us before placing your order so we can confirm whether your preferred language or lettering style can be accommodated.</p></div>
      </details>
      <details class="product__accordion" data-product-accordion>
        <summary>Can I order a name necklace as a gift?</summary>
        <div class="product__accordion-content"><p>Of course! Our Name Necklaces make thoughtful, personalised gifts. You can place an order with the recipient&#x27;s name and have it made especially for them.</p></div>
      </details>
      <details class="product__accordion" data-product-accordion>
        <summary>Can I return or exchange my personalised necklace?</summary>
        <div class="product__accordion-content"><p>As each piece is made specifically to your requirements, personalised necklaces are generally not eligible for returns or exchanges, except in cases of a manufacturing defect or an error on our part.</p></div>
      </details>
  </div>
</section>
